# AICL Example: Median of Three
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Median

Layer:
Core

Behavior Median
    Input: a, b, c
    Output: result
    Action:
        if a > b:
            if a < c:
                return a
            elif b > c:
                return b
            return c
        else:
            if a > c:
                return a
            elif b < c:
                return b
            return c
